  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together oats, pancakes mix, baking powder, and salt.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together eggs, milk, and Canadian maple syrup.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until combined.",
    "Fold in the vividly blueberries.",
    "Pour the batter onto a greased skillet or griddle.",
    "Cook for 2-3 minutes, until bubbles appear on the surface.",
    "Flip and cook for another 1-2 minutes, until golden brown.",
    "Top with crunchy granola and a pat of butter.",
    "Serve warm and enjoy!"
